more than one of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/d21cdac9489ebe470015b2c215bcbc3a.poster.avif?t=1788191396\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/d21cdac9489ebe470015b2c215bcbc3a.webm?t=1788191396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/d21cdac9489ebe470015b2c215bcbc3a.mp4?t=1788191396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Road to Champion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the ranks. Start in Not Graded races, break into Listed company, then push through Group 3, Group 2 and up to Group 1, the level where horses earn a place in the record books. Every horse has its own grade. Every race has an entry tier. Moving up the ladder means picking the right targets, preparing properly, and timing your shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/19670842bf4289572702bf66e9f2cbed.poster.avif?t=1788191396\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/19670842bf4289572702bf66e9f2cbed.webm?t=1788191396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/19670842bf4289572702bf66e9f2cbed.mp4?t=1788191396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Succession and Social Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a dynasty. Marry, raise kids and pass the stable down through the generations. Your children inherit your traits and grow into jockeys, trainers or managers in their own right. Decades later, the bloodlines you bred will still be running, with your family name still on the silks. Along the way, deal with jockeys, trainers, owners and journalists through social events and personal relationships that shape your contracts, your reputation and your long-term decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/55e5d1cc8a3c40bca46f2bd0515795c0.poster.avif?t=1788191396\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/55e5d1cc8a3c40bca46f2bd0515795c0.webm?t=1788191396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/55e5d1cc8a3c40bca46f2bd0515795c0.mp4?t=1788191396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Training and Care</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop each horse the way you want. Choose training routines, set feeding plans, and decide how hard to push. Rest, conditioning and nutrition all matter. Get the balance right and you'll see the difference on race day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/3a7a9e1f7fa45786d92a61f3fcdb199e.poster.avif?t=1788191396\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/3a7a9e1f7fa45786d92a61f3fcdb199e.webm?t=1788191396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/3a7a9e1f7fa45786d92a61f3fcdb199e.mp4?t=1788191396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Staff Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire and manage jockeys, trainers, veterinarians and support staff. A good trainer turns potential into wins. A bad jockey throws away a race you should have won. Your staff are as important as your horses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/e9303d7c8a6603d72dfc6e3feeafe7e3.poster.avif?t=1788191396\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/e9303d7c8a6603d72dfc6e3feeafe7e3.mp4?t=1788191396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Facility Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build out your stable. Construct and upgrade specialised facilities, each one with its own impact on training, horse development, staff performance and race results. A well-built base is the difference between average runners and serious contenders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/e8db57d30fde956686ac4135b7a5b42a.poster.avif?t=1788191396\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/e8db57d30fde956686ac4135b7a5b42a.webm?t=1788191396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740170/extras/e8db57d30fde956686ac4135b7a5b42a.mp4?t=1788191396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stable starts small. Only a few become legends. Build the stable, breed the horses, win the races, leave a name behind. The rest is up to you.</p>",
